# NOTICE — Third-party attribution

This repository contains trained weights of the model **CNN-BiLSTM (Russian audio
emotion classification)**. The model was trained from scratch on mel-spectrogram
features of the Dusha corpus (no third-party model backbones are embedded in the
weights).

## Pretrained components

| Component | Source | License | Relation |
|---|---|---|---|
| None (architecture trained from scratch) | — | — | The weights do not contain any third-party model parameters |

Feature extraction (mel-spectrograms, 64 bins, 16 kHz) follows the Dusha/Golos
data pipeline, which is derived from the Salute Developers project (see below).

## Training data

| Dataset | Source | License | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Dusha (Salute Developers / Sber) | <https://github.com/salute-developers/golos/tree/master/dusha> · arXiv:2212.12266 | Dusha/Golos, attribution + share-alike (a reworked CC BY-SA 4.0) | Trained on `combine_balanced` = Dusha-only blocked corpus |

